      "body": "### Summary\n\nThe apt module should support `-t=target_release` in order to install from `backports`, e.g.\r\n```\r\napt-get -t bullseye-backports install ...\r\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nFeature Idea\n\n### Component Name\n\napt\n\n### Additional Information\n\n<!--- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below -->\r\n```yaml (paste below)\r\n- name: Install from backports\r\n  ansible.builtin.apt:\r\n    name: some-package\r\n    release: bullseye-backports\r\n    state: present\r\n```\r\n\n\n### Code of Conduct\n\n- [X] I agree to follow the Ansible Code of Conduct",
